Rule File Pathname: mydrc.drc
Maximum space (S2) from any point within the Source/Drain region to the nearest pickup AA region inside the same well for I/O and internal circuits. (7.3.8 Fig.2)
For native device, DRC check the pickup AA inside the PSUB butted PW area, and PW is still treated as connection by substrate even one NW ring inserted. <= 35 um
